# 033 · Slots made easy

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.4.0](../roadmap.md#v040)

## What

Show a slot's quota and limits (read-only). Add a helper that writes out the namespace, service account, role, role binding, quota and network rules for a cluster's operator to apply. Publish the role's verbs in the docs. Decide whether several rigs can share one slot.

## Why

A cluster's operator must know exactly what a slot needs before they make one.

## Done when

- [ ] The helper's output applies cleanly on a local cluster.
- [ ] The several-rigs-per-slot question has an answer in the docs.

## Decisions

- 2026-10-19, owner: The owner asked whether several rigs can fit in one slot. Today it is one rig per slot, because quota and network rules are per namespace.

## Open questions

None.

## Progress

- 2026-10-19: Goal written from the roadmap.

